<title>SOUTH KOREA: Korea Telecom in 500 bln won overseas share issue. [CORRECTED 08:37 GMT]</title>
<headline>Korea Telecom in 500 bln won overseas share issue. [CORRECTED 08:37 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's finance and economy ministry said on Thursday it would sell about 500 billion won worth of shares in state-run Korea Telecom by issuing overseas depositary receipts.</p>
<p>(Corrects type of issue in headline)</p>
</text>
